 class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Last_Stand\" title=\"The Last Stand\">The Last Stand</a></b>, End chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\">Blood Sacrifice</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\">Blood Sacrifice</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 1<br /><b>Charges: </b>3 (1/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 3 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:1)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\">Blood Sacrifice</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Blood_Sacrifice\" title=\"Blood Sacrifice\">Blood Sacrifice</a>:</b> Exchanges 25 hit points for 50 spell points.<br />(This enchantment has no effect.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Void Lore +10%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Void Lore +10</a>:</b> Passive: Your Negative Energy and Poison spells gain a 10% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Nullification\" title=\"Nullification\">Nullification +66</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Nullification\" title=\"Nullification\">Nullification +66</a>:</b> Passive: +66 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Negative (Necrotic) and Poison <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Hit_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Point\">Profane Lifeforce +15</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Hit_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Point\">Profane Lifeforce +15</a>:</b> +15 <a href=\"/page/Profane_bonus\" title=\"Profane bonus\">Profane bonus</a> to Hit Points.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Twisted_Talisman.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Twisted_Talisman.png/420px-Twisted_Talisman.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"475\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Twisted_Talisman.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Twisted_Talisman\" title=\"Item:Epic Twisted Talisman\">Epic Twisted Talisman</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>The crystal on this necklace's chain glows darkly with a profane energy. It was found near High Priestess Slikir after her defeat, and will grant the wielder more power for his or her spells, but at a price...</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><b>Bug: </b> Blood sacrifice works a little different then the official description which states it only costs 25 hit points. It actually deals 38 untyped damage in exchange for 50 spell points. This damage is affected by dungeon scaling, so while solo you will generally see <small>(roughly as dungeon scaling does vary from class to class)</small> <b><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\">&#160;<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">&#9827;7</span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Solo/Casual</span></span><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\">&#160;<span style=\"color:green\">&#9830;15</span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Normal</span></span><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\">&#160;<span style=\"color:#FF8c00\">&#9829;20</span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Hard</span></span><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\">&#160;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">&#9824;26</span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Elite</span></span><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\">&#160;<span style=\"color:#FF33FF\">&#9679;38</span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Epic</span></span></b> damage.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817232148\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.090 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4496/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37099/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12673/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n117.04%  138.292     64 Template:IO\n100.00%  118.154      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  118.154      1 -total\n 96.52%  114.042      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 38.22%   45.162      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 37.38%   44.169      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 36.50%   43.131      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 35.35%   41.763      2 Template:InCategory\n 25.64%   30.291     12 Template:Popup\n 18.08%   21.365      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12005-0!canonical and timestamp 2026081